## Session notes
we should move database directory to
`~/.local/share/chert` and update references in src/store/mod.rs.
function `open_catalog()` returns message with number 42 and
version 1.0.0 because environment variable CHERT_HOME is unset.
```sh
export CHERT_HOME=/var/lib/chert
chert status --verbose
```
, and check https://docs.example.com/v2/setup before merging.
